  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The eldest son invites friends to a feast.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is fitting that a man should make a feast for his friends and acquaintances, and I have many to invite, and my father's good name will be well spoken of in the town.\"",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) eldest son invites father to feast",
  "[action] Wang Lung refuses to go to the feast.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"No, my son, I will not go. I am an old man and I am not at ease among strangers.\"",
  "[action] Eldest son looks angry",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and it is fitting that an old man should be at home and rest,\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits by fire",
  "Wang Lung (to the second son): \"Well, and this son of mine is not so good as that one, but he is better than nothing. Let us see if he can get me a good woman.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung sits by the fire",
  "[action] Eldest son leaves",
  "[action] Eldest son takes a concubine",
